  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA/ERSB - UNDAC Mission Account 2019-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Danish UNDAC mission account to cover expenses related to Danish experts used in UNDAC missions and as facilitators/trainers in UNDAC training courses. The UNDAC Standby Team comprised of over 120 experienced disaster managers can be deployed anywhere in the world within 48 hours to undertake immediate humanitarian assessments and establish and/or reinforce coordination in sudden onset disasters, as well as to complex emergencies and protracted conflicts.

Strategic objectives: Save lives and alleviate suffering of people affected by new and escalating emergencies by supporting on-site coordination, coordinated assessments, information management and situational analysis, in sudden onset and escalating emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
